def _mirror_partner(bone_id: str) -> str | None:
    """`upper-arm-l` -> `upper-arm-r`, `thumb-l-1` -> `thumb-r-1`. None when not a left id.

    Digit ids carry the side in the MIDDLE (`thumb-l-1`), so matching only a trailing `-l` would
